<section class="section"><div class="container article-body">
<h2>How to Order a DQ Cake</h2>
  <p>DQ Cakes are a signature offering across all DQ locations. Find the full cake lineup and prices on <a href="/">The Dairy Queen Menu</a>. Here is how ordering works:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>48 hours minimum</strong> — Call or visit your local DQ at least 48 hours before your event for custom messages and designs</li>
    <li><strong>Choose your size</strong> — 8-inch (8–10 people), 10-inch (12–16 people), or Sheet Cake (24–32 people)</li>
    <li><strong>Choose your flavor</strong> — Classic DQ, Oreo Blizzard, Cookie Dough Blizzard, Reese's Blizzard, or Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard</li>
    <li><strong>Add your message</strong> — Personalized writing on the cake is standard</li>
    <li><strong>Optional photo topper</strong> — Available at select locations, call ahead to confirm</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>DQ Cake Layers — What's Inside</h2>
  <p>Every DQ Cake is built in the same layer structure, regardless of size:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Top layer</strong> — Whipped topping with decoration and personalized message</li>
    <li><strong>Soft serve layer</strong> — Your chosen flavor (classic, Oreo Blizzard, etc.)</li>
    <li><strong>Crunchy center</strong> — DQ's signature fudge and crunch layer — the defining element that sets DQ cakes apart from standard ice cream cakes</li>
    <li><strong>Bottom soft serve layer</strong> — Second layer of soft serve below the crunch</li>
    <li><strong>Base</strong> — Solid frozen base to support the layers</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Classic DQ Cake vs. Blizzard Cake</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th></th><th>Classic DQ Cake</th><th>Blizzard Cake (e.g. Oreo)</th></tr></thead>
