      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Call or visit your local DQ at least 48 hours before you need it. Choose size, flavor, and personalized message.</div></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Can I pick up a DQ Cake same day?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Many locations keep pre-made cakes in the freezer for same-day purchase without custom messages. For personalized cakes, 48-hour advance notice is required.</div></div></div></div>
